; RT50 / PT50 (#744). Expectations never obtained by running Tecnigrafo.
; solid-space tests/corpus/casi/geom2d/ at fc8cae3da8a737510d6b61075b03ea3272228576:
; ellipse-nearest-mm-arco-estremo.json: same endpoint proof for start -45 degrees
; instead of -0.8 radians (x<=10,y<=0 throughout either arc, nearest end at 0).
A = ELLIPSE center=0,0 major-axis=10,0 ratio=0.5 start=-45 end=0
? inside A 7,-4 11,1 -> yes
; PT50 takes distance and closest from the arc, never its extension.
; cambia con #744
? distance A 12,2 -> 2.8284271247461903
? closest A 12,2 -> 10,0
? snaps A modes=endpoint -> Endpoint 7.0710678118654755,-3.5355339059327378; Endpoint 10,0
? snap 10.1,0.1 aperture=0.5 modes=endpoint -> Endpoint 10,0
? crosses A 9.9,-0.1 10.1,0.1 -> yes
? crosses A -1,4 1,6 -> no
? pick 0,5 tolerance=0.1 -> none
; Corpus rettangolo-parte-mancante-arco.json, same 0..pi parameters.
Upper = ELLIPSE center=40,0 major-axis=10,0 ratio=0.5 start=0 end=180
? crosses Upper 39,-6 41,-4 -> no
? crosses Upper 49.9,-0.1 50.1,0.1 -> yes
? window 29,-1 51,6 -> Upper
? crossing 39,-6 41,-4 -> none
